  "genie_instructions": "DOMAIN CONTEXT\nThis space supports manufacturing resource planning and capacity optimization at PlanWorks. Stakeholders: Production Planner and Scheduler (work-order release, queue management, expedites), VP Operations (schedule adherence, work-center utilization, throughput), and CFO (labor efficiency, overtime spend, capex justification for added capacity).\n\nMETRIC DEFINITIONS\n- Schedule adherence = AVG(schedule_adherence_pct); target ≥90%.\n- Capacity utilization = AVG(utilization_pct); sweet spot 80–90%.\n- On-time completion = AVG(on_time_completion_pct); target ≥95%.\n- Throughput = SUM(throughput_units) and SUM(completed_qty).\n- Efficiency = AVG(efficiency_pct) = standard hours / actual hours; target ≥90%.\n- Overtime = SUM(overtime_hours); cost and capacity-stress signal.\n- Changeover = SUM(changeover_hours); SMED reduction target year-over-year.\n- Queue hours = AVG(queue_hours); bottleneck identifier.\n\nQUERY GUIDANCE\n- ALWAYS prefer metric views with MEASURE() syntax for aggregations.\n  - work_orders_metrics (source: work_orders) — dims: wo_date, work_center_type, wo_status, priority; measures: total_work_orders, total_planned_hours, total_actual_hours, total_completed_qty, unique_work_center_count, total_planned_qty.\n  - planning_kpi_metrics (source: planning_kpi_monthly) — dims: kpi_month, work_center_type; measures: avg_schedule_adherence, total_throughput, avg_efficiency, avg_on_time_completion, total_changeover_hours, unique_work_center_count.\n- Use GROUP BY ALL with MEASURE() queries.\n- For monthly trends, always wrap the date in DATE_TRUNC('month', <date_col>).\n- For \"Top X\" requests, return LIMIT 10 unless the user specifies otherwise.\n- Query base tables directly only when needing columns not exposed by metric views (e.g. work_center_id, queue_hours, overtime_hours, headcount, wo_status, priority).\n- When the user's phrasing matches a SQL snippet display name (filters, expressions, or measures), prefer that snippet.",
  "sample_questions": [
    "Top 10 work centers by capacity utilization this month — which are above 95% and risk overtime?",
    "What is the monthly trend in schedule adherence by work center type over the trailing 12 months?",
    "Which work centers have the highest overtime hours, and how does that correlate with utilization?",
    "Rank work center types by on-time work order completion — which are below the 95% target?",
    "Show monthly trend in total throughput vs planned hours across all work centers.",
    "Top 10 work centers by changeover hours — where is the biggest SMED opportunity?",
    "Which work centers have the longest queue hours, and how is throughput trending there?"
  ],
  "example_sqls": [
    {
      "question": "What is the monthly trend in highest planned qty?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT wo_date, MEASURE(max_planned_qty) AS max_planned_qty",
        "FROM {fqn}.work_orders_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY wo_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has total planned hours changed over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT wo_date, MEASURE(total_planned_hours) AS total_planned_hours",
        "FROM {fqn}.work_orders_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY wo_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the monthly trend in total throughput units?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT kpi_month, MEASURE(total_throughput) AS total_throughput",
        "FROM {fqn}.planning_kpi_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY kpi_month"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has total changeover hours changed over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT kpi_month, MEASURE(total_changeover_hours) AS total_changeover_hours",
        "FROM {fqn}.planning_kpi_metrics",
        "GROUP BY ALL",
        "ORDER BY kpi_month"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How does total planned production quantity break down by work center identifier for 'Released' records?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT work_center_id, COUNT(*) AS record_count, SUM(planned_qty) AS total_planned_qty",
        "FROM {fqn}.work_orders",
        "WHERE wo_status = 'Released' GROUP BY work_center_id ORDER BY total_planned_qty DESC"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "What is the trend of total available capacity in hours over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT snapshot_date, SUM(available_hours) AS total_available_hours",
        "FROM {fqn}.capacity_snapshots",
        "GROUP BY snapshot_date ORDER BY snapshot_date"
      ]
    },
    {
      "question": "How has the average schedule adherence percentage changed over time?",
      "sql_lines": [
        "SELECT kpi_month, AVG(schedule_adherence_pct) AS avg_schedule_adherence_pct",
        "FROM {fqn}.planning_kpi_monthly",
        "GROUP BY kpi_month ORDER BY kpi_month"
      ]
    }
